\caption{\label{fig:frames} Illustration of the helicity basis vectors ${\hat{\vb n}, \hat{\vb r}, \hat{\vb k}}$ and the unit vector $\hat{\vb p}$ of the photon momentum, defined in the center-of-mass frame, alongside the unit vectors ${\hat{\vb l}+, \hat{\vb l}-}$ of the fermionic decay products (indicating momentum directions), shown in their respective parent particle rest frames, where the spin of each particle and the decay spin density matrices are also conventionally defined.} 
