CYTransformer achieves consistently higher similarity scores with lower variance, indicating that its sampling distribution more faithfully captures the true structure of the FRST space. In contrast, the fast sampler shows lower similarity and broader spread, confirming that it introduces a stronger sampling bias even when the total coverage is similar.

