Physically, the anyon line along the interval gives a symmetry operator along the interval, decorated by local operators at its endpoints corresponding to splitting of this anyon line into lines that end on $\mathfrak{B}_{\mathrm{sym}}$ and/or $\mathfrak{B}_{\mathcal{L}}$. Such an operator thereby furnishing a nonzero disorder parameter:
