The group characterizing $\cL_4$ is $\wt{F}_4=(\Z_3\times\Z_3)\rtimes\Z_2$, generated by the group elements $a_L,a_R,b_Lb_R$.
On the physical boundary, the anyons in in \eqref{SandoF4} give rise to charged local operators $\cO_{g}$ corresponding a representative of each conjugacy class of $\wt{F}_4$:
\be\ba
[a_L]&=\{a_L,\,a^2_L\}\,,& [a_R]&=\{a_R,\,a^2_R\}\,,\\
[a_La_R]&=\{a_La_R,\,a_La^2_R\}\,,& [a_La^2_R]&=\{a_La^2_R,\,a^2La_R\}\,,\\
[b_Lb_R]&=b_Lb_R\,.
