Indeed, we can derive the autocovariance $C_{\Upsilon}\left(\Delta,\tau\right):=cov\left(\frac{\Upsilon([0,\Delta])}{\Delta},\frac{\Upsilon([\tau,\tau+\Delta])}{\Delta}\right)$ for any $\Delta>0$ as follows:
\begin{eqnarray}
\label{eq:autocovCdeltatautheo}
    C_{\Upsilon}\left(\Delta,\tau\right)=\frac{1}{2H(1-2H)}-\left(\frac{\tau}{T}\right)^{2H}\tilde{g}_{H}\left(\frac{\Delta}{\tau}\right)
\end{eqnarray}




