\item A generalized linear canonical Wigner distribution (GLWD) is proposed, which has superior time-frequency (TF) resolution and noise resistance.
\item The mobile long line segment detection (M-LLSD) is proposed, which can better detect continuous long straight lines and is more suitable for target detection in ISRJ scenarios.
\end{highlights}

