The main process of the anti-ISRJ method proposed in this paper is shown in Fig. ~\ref{fig4}. First, the TF image is obtained by performing GLWD processing on the received signal. Then, the TF position of the target signal in the received signal is extracted using M-LLSD. In addition, a filter is designed to filter the STFT to eliminate ISRJ, and the time domain signal is obtained by inverse STFT. finally, PC is performed to obtain the radar one-dimensional range profile.
