    % Then because $K_n=\bigsqcup_{t\in I}K_n\cap tH$, for any finite subset $I_0\subset I$, we have 
    % $\mu_G(K_n)\ge \sum_{t\in I_0}\mu_G(K_n\cap tH)$. Therefore, 
    % $\sum_{t\in I}\mu_G(K_n\cap tH)\le \mu_G(K_n)<\infty$. 
