    $\text{(ii)}\implies \text{(i)}.$ Note that $d\mu_x(yH)=\rho(xy)/\rho(y)d\mu(yH)$ for all $x,y\in G$ (see \cite[Theorem 2.58]{Folland}). Thus, we obtain 
