		$$\int_0^{\overline{\theta}}  \left[ \left(\phi(\theta)+\frac{1-\lambda}{\lambda}\right) A(\lambda) V^{s,1}_g(\theta) - \gamma\frac{V^{s,1}_g(\theta)}{\lambda} -c\left(V^{s,1}_g(\theta)\right)\right] f(\theta) d\theta.$$
