 Since $\chi(Y)=0$ for each closed 3-manifold, by the gluing formula of $\chi$, it is easy to see that $\chi(W_1)=0$, and then 
 $\chi(W_2)=2$. So we have $1\le \chi_b(L(5,1))\le 2$. 

