    \caption{\textbf{Left}: A series of simulations showing a Burgers bore ($u_0=3$) overtaking compound solitons with different speed in the bore's moving frame. Dashed lines indicate the  position $x^*(t)=\operatorname{argmax}_x v(t)$ of the soliton/solitary wave peak over time.\textbf{Right}: Summary of refraction and reflection type outcomes for different $u_0$ and $c$ values under the viscosity $\eta=0.01$. The dotted line indicates the approximate threshold $c^*\approx u_0/5$ separating the two regimes.}
    \label{fig:phase1}
